      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Accomplisht Cook\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Robert May, 1660 (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#robert-may-1660\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERobert May 1660\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E);",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make a Chiveridge Pudding.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nLay the fattest of a hog in fair water and salt to scowr them, then take the longest and fattest gut, and stuff it with nutmeg, sugar, ginger, pepper, and slic\u0027t dates, cut them and serve them to the table.\u003Cbr\u003E"
